                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>TANGHULU E-Gift Card is redeemable exclusively on TANGHULU.US official website. E-Gift Cards are delivered by email and contain instructions on how to redeem at checkout. Simply forward the email to the gift recipient. It cannot be exchanged for cash or combined with other discounts. Lost or stolen cards will not be replaced. Refunds for returned items purchased with the E-Gift Card will be credited back to the card.</p>",
