                  "blocks": {
                    "text_GfzQ6x": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p><strong>how do i send an e-gift card?</strong>digital gift cards have the following delivery options:<br/><br/>same-day delivery: gift cards are delivered to your recipient’s email within an hour after purchase.<br/><br/>future scheduled delivery: schedule a gift card to be sent to your recipient’s email at a later date. scheduled gift cards are delivered at 12am pst on the selected day.<br/><br/><strong>where can an e-gift card be used?</strong>gift cards purchased on kyliecosmetics.com and can only be redeemed on kyliecosmetics.com for us purchases.<br/><br/><strong>can i use more than one gift card on a single purchase?</strong>yes, you can apply multiple gift cards to one order at checkout, as long as the combined balance covers the purchase total.<br/><br/><strong>do gift cards expire?</strong>no, gift cards never expire.<br/><br/><strong>can gift cards be returned?</strong>all gift card purchases are final sale and cannot be returned.<br/><br/><strong>can I cancel a scheduled gift card delivery?</strong>scheduled gift card deliveries may not be canceled once the purchase is completed. please double-check details before confirming your order.<br/><br/><strong>what if my gift card doesn’t arrive in the recipient’s inbox?</strong>if the recipient hasn’t received the gift card within the expected delivery time, please check the spam or promotions folder. if it’s still missing, please contact us for support.<br/><br/><strong>can i check the balance of my gift card?</strong>yes, you can check your gift card balance by clicking<a href=\"https://kyliecosmetics.com/a/govalo/lookup\">here</a>.</p>",
